          "text": "But Nineveh ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "is",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
          "text": " of old like a pool of water: yet they shall flee away. Stand, stand, ",
          "kind": "text"
        },
        {
          "text": "shall they cry",
          "kind": "supplied"
        },
        {
